          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walakini, kwa sababu huyo Mhubiri alikuwa na hekima, aliendelea kuwafundisha watu maarifa, naam, akatafakari, akatafuta-tafuta, akatunga mithali nyingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huyo Mhubiri akatafuta-tafuta ili apate kuona maneno yapendezayo, na yale yaliyoandikwa kwa unyofu, yaani, maneno ya kweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maneno yao wenye hekima huwa mfano wa michokoo; na kama misumari iliyogongomewa sana; ndivyo yalivyo maneno yao walio wakuu wa makusanyiko, ambayo yatoka kwa mchungaji mmoja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tena, zaidi ya hayo, mwanangu, kubali maonyo; hakuna mwisho wo wote wa kutunga vitabu vingi; na kusoma sana huuchosha mwili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
